  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Solutions keep all their projects on the SDKs that pull references into dotnet sln add.\n\n- A newer .NET SDK adds a project's references along with it in dotnet sln add, which lost projects from All.sln and broke builds on some runners; the template and dotskit ask for the project alone and fall back for older SDKs.\n\nHow to update a solution generated from an earlier version: https://github.com/sawking-tech/DotNetSolutionKit/blob/v2.9.2/docs/getting-started/upgrading.md",
